'''Darkswirl''' is an [[Effects|effect]] that is obtainable by purchasing the [[Darkness Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Halloween Event 2023]]. It is now unobtainable as the gamepass has since went offsale.

==Appearance==
With this effect equipped, a black aura appears around the player’s knife. When a player is killed by a knife with this effect, a black aura is emitted from their corpse. 

==Trivia== 
*This is the only item within the [[Darkness Bundle]] that cannot be purchased from a separate gamepass.
*This is the second godly effect to be introduced into the game, the first being [[Flow]].

